    "question": {
      ":question/id": "ebe5b8e1-0a53-5f30-b330-d637b49369c5",
      ":question/problem": "![](/tmp/course-academy-g2-readonly-tly0pcma/17592186166865/caller-hard/generated/727ee95ec3b0e1377aaf365b.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the circle shown above.",
